  "name": "CyTools_Trellis2Texture",
  "displayName": "CyTools Trellis2Texture",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Generates the PBR channels of an existing 3D mesh: Base Color, Metallic, Roughness and Alpha. Colour carried by the mesh is baked into a UV atlas; channels the mesh does not carry are derived with documented deterministic heuristics. CPU only, no neural model.",
